<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-12T13:00:27.470Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:00:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamic State-linked rebels killed at least 22 people in eastern DR Congo while Allied Democratic Forces militants attacked Cantine in North Kivu, adding to the insecurity. A military court sentenced 66 Congolese soldiers to death for cowardice after they fled an attack by FRN rebels. Ebola cases have exceeded 11,000 with 5,387 deaths and cholera has killed 1,800 people, prompting WHO warnings. An L-410 aircraft crashed during an emergency landing, killing 17 people. President Tshisekedi is paving the way for constitutional change, and the M23 campaign continues, with 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE1ZM3Z4SVhSd0VjV3UyQUFtb1V3NUhmVHNJWXo5eEZmLUdjVzQ1SkV6Zkl3SzlhclEtRUJmcEZmVFdJeFNxbXU5YXN2cEpjY1pocnNxLWhvWVkyRnJCdF9ZTXotdHVWS3lXX0lKMWNOME90VjRDSFpmaTNNclc0eUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPZG1waG1xOHJUdGpBcUdNUXNmSUJ6bUctdFFZMmw4OVhPUmdUTzdSMVJWOFJ1N1dLWDVVcVh6MDY5VlRmT2tZSFJIWFZrU1E2RmxtV1JRaDE0Q3dJcEVtMHUza3Z2d1Bla3FMcWZqeUgxRjBZQ1pEODhzUHVHZHA0aFBSZXdlWElQU1JxbVE3cEtYS01Nel9XbUNxbGwwYXVVQVlCUHA4YTIyS0RjVTVPMQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5hWENNVUc2eUc4ajBIQlZ4aUF5RnF2TnJCVlFCY0RrNkhZbTBweGRlemxnbEY0ZTk0bl9CcnpFRTU2ZmdKSExyNzRMdnNnZlIzRjFoQ0dEMDV1YVlSV1HSAWNBVV95cUxQS1JVQ0YwOWdKbUs4QTlUWWFoSjZUbEhyRndCa1pvWnJPYW5KTHpoV0xqZnlwV3V6NkVnRHp4TzFJemFTcEpaYkxXNk9pVzFWaTZ0U2loXzBwMnFvYmNyamZzMmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBZVTFvYm1hNVUzaXN2QndFdjgzN0RQVGlsVVNBMzhCLUNhRUh